er\" aria-label=\"Joe (Big Money) Lopez on Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg> @bigmoney_cutz</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>서비스 및 가격</summary><ul><li><span>커트(삭발 또는 신사 스타일) / 기본 볼드 페이드</span><b>$40</b></li><li><span>커트와 수염 + 면도칼</span><b>$55</b></li><li><span>핫타월 거품 면도칼 면도(수염 정리/라인업)</span><b>$35</b></li><li><span>전통 핫타월/거품 면도칼 면도</span><b>$60</b></li><li><span>스타일 변신 커트(커트 + 가위 작업)</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>프레지덴셜 서비스<small>수염, 핫타월이 포함된 풀 서비스 커트에 페이셜, 샴푸, 블랙 마스크 중 택1</small></span><b>$100</b></li><li><span>영업시간 외</span><b>$80</b></li><li><span>코털 왁싱</span><b>$10</b></li></ul></details></article><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">T</div><div><h3>ThatBoy_Reezy</h3><p>Jared Gruder · 바버</p></div></div><p class=\"member-rating\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span> 5.0 · 리뷰 23개</p><div class=\"member-links\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jared 예약 →</a></div><details class=\"member-svc\"><summary>서비스 및 가격</summary><ul><li><span>커트</span><b>$40</b></li><li><span>커트/수염/라인업</span><b>$60</b></li><li><span>커트 &amp; 가위 작업</span><b>$50</b></li><li><span>수염 라인업</span><b>$20</b></li><li><span>어르신 65세 이상</span><b>$30</b></li></ul></details></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">알아두세요</p><h2>편의시설 및 이용 안내</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>온라인 예약</b><span>모든 바버가 온라인 예약을 받습니다</span></li><li><b>일요일은 예약제로만</b></li><li><b>휠체어 접근 가능</b></li><li><b>신용카드 가능</b></li><li><b>무료 Wi-Fi</b></li><li><b>주차 공간</b><span>자전거 주차도 가능</span></li><li><b>아이 동반 환영</b></li><li><b>어르신 &amp; 군인 가격</b><span>여러 바버가 65세 이상과 군인/응급 구조대원 가격을 제공합니다</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">갤러리</p><h2>Marty&#39;s 내부</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Marty&#39;s 내부의 바버 자리\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"로우 테이퍼 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/hot-towel-shave.jpg\" alt=\"핫타월 면도\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade.jpg\" alt=\"막 자른 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard.jpg\" alt=\"수염 다듬기와 라인업\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"옆가르마 + 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/kids-fade.jpg\" alt=\"어린이 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/team.jpg\" alt=\"가게 입구의 바버들\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">리뷰</p><h2>고객 후기</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 리뷰 176개</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 리뷰 1332개</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Marty’s Barbershop delivers excellent service in a professional and welcoming environment. Marty is highly skilled, consistent and provides great hospitality. My Barber, Foofades is also outstanding, with great attention to detail and overall an amazing guy to talk to.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Best barber out in Vacaville, never disappointed me every time I came in🫡💯”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jaden · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/263621_martythebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I was literally walking out of my doctors appointment thinking about looking for a barber when I crossed paths with the owner. He brought me in and the vibes were amazing. Great people, amazing skills and overall amazing experience. It didn’t feel like going in to just get a cut. I got an experience.You gotta get a fresh cut from these guys.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Viv does an amazing job! She’s thorough, detail-oriented, and listens to her clients. Every haircut I’ve gotten from her is great and grows out well between cuts!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kendra · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/658054_hercuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Thank you, Hudson for making our first experience at this barbershop and with you great! It is evident you take pride in your craft and the results show for itself. We are very satisfied with our son’s haircut by you. I definitely recommend booking with him. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Jared always does a great job. Great attention to Detail and many years of experience. If you’re looking for a new barber,Jared is the guy. He’s been cutting my hair for over 10 years.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Bradley · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“He cut my haircut like how I imagined it. Takes his time and doesn’t rush. Cleanest skin mid fade in the area”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nish · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/966669_joe-big-money-lopez_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Carlos provided a great cut along with efficient timing, I would highly recommend his services!👌🏽”</blockquote><figcaption>— Emani · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593463_losblendzz_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“10/10 recommend this shop! Marty cuts my sons hair an always is quick, smooth and always makes my sons experience exceptional. If your not getting your hair cut here your missing out.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great haircut, Good convo &amp; Good vibes. Eli got me right. Thanks!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alex024 · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1244424_fadezbyeli-martysbarbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">자주 묻는 질문</p><h2>궁금한 점을 알려드려요</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>예약이 필요한가요?</summary><p>저희 누구든 온라인으로 예약할 수 있습니다. 일요일은 예약제로만 운영하고, 평일과 토요일 영업시간에는 예약 없이 오셔도 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>커트 가격은 얼마인가요?</summary><p>일반 커트는 바버에 따라 $40–$50입니다. 현재 가격은 바버의 예약 페이지에서 확인하세요.</p></details><details><summary>어르신이나 군인 할인이 있나요?</summary><p>네. 여러 바버가 어르신(65세 이상) 커트를 $30에, 군인/응급 구조대원 커트를 $35–$40에 해 드립니다.</p></details><details><summary>핫타월 면도도 하나요?</summary><p>물론이죠. Marty는 전통 면도를 $40에, 커트와 핫타월 전통 면도를 $75에 합니다. Viviana와 Joe도 전통 면도칼 면도를 합니다.</p></details><details><summary>카드 받나요?</summary><p>네, 카드 받습니다.</p></details><details><summary>Wi-Fi와 휠체어 접근이 되나요?</summary><p>네. 무료 Wi-Fi가 있고 휠체어로도 들어오실 수 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>영업시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>월–금요일 오전 9시–오후 6시, 토요일 오전 9시–오후 3시 영업합니다. 일요일은 예약제로만 운영합니다.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">방문 안내</p>\n      <h2>영업시간 및 위치</h2>\n      <address>2611 Nut Tree Rd Ste E<br>Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\">(707) 660-8108</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>월요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>화요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>수요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>목요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>금요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>토요일</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>일요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">일요일은 예약제로만 운영합니다.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martysbarbershop_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@martysbarbershop_</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></svg><span>Booksy</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 전화</a>\n        <a cla